<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Lucerne Hammer</h1>
<p>Type of Weapon: Close and Distanced Hand-to-hand.
</p><p>This weapon is very similar to the halberd, but the spike on its end was generally longer than that of a halberd, and instead of an axe head the Lucerne hammer featured a smaller, hammer-like head with three prongs. This function was not as efficient against armor as the axe.
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="In_Valhalla">In Valhalla</span></h2>
<p>In Valhalla there is no Lucerne hammer skill of its own: such a weapon is fought with the skill of the kind of weapon it is. Look at it to see which (see <a cmd='#'>Help Weapons</a>).
</p><p><br />
See Also:
